      "q_source": "stage2_test_predictions.csv",
      "step_number": 2,
      "text": "Step 2: The coordinates of the centroid \\( G \\) of triangle \\( ABC \\) with vertices \\( A(x_1, y_1) \\), \\( B(x_2, y_2) \\), and \\( C(x_3, y_3) \\) are given by:\n\\[ G = \\left( \\frac{x_1 + x_2 + x_3}{3}, \\frac{y_1 + y_2 + y_3}{3} \\right). \\]",
      "z": 3.4817927055214684
    },
    {
