      "q_source": "stage2_test_predictions.csv",
      "step_number": 3,
      "text": "Step 3: The orthocenter \\( H \\) can be expressed in terms of the vertices' coordinates, but for simplicity, we use vector notation. Let \\( \\vec{A} = \\vec{a} \\), \\( \\vec{B} = \\vec{b} \\), and \\( \\vec{C} = \\vec{c} \\). Then,\n\\[ \\vec{G} = \\frac{\\vec{a} + \\vec{b} + \\vec{c}}{3}. \\]",
      "z": 5.139216654411356
    },
