      "q": 0.9670980316148687,
      "q_source": "stage2_test_predictions.csv",
      "step_number": 4,
      "text": "Step 4: The midpoint \\( F \\) of \\( \\overline{GH} \\) is:\n\\[ \\vec{F} = \\frac{\\vec{G} + \\vec{H}}{2} = \\frac{\\frac{\\vec{a} + \\vec{b} + \\vec{c}}{3} + \\vec{H}}{2} = \\frac{\\vec{a} + \\vec{b} + \\vec{c} + 3\\vec{H}}{6}. \\]",
      "z": 3.3807673820558417
    },
