      "q_source": "stage2_test_predictions.csv",
      "step_number": 5,
      "text": "Step 5: We need to find \\( AF^2 + BF^2 + CF^2 \\). Using the distance formula in vector form, we have:\n\\[ AF^2 = |\\vec{F} - \\vec{A}|^2, \\]\n\\[ BF^2 = |\\vec{F} - \\vec{B}|^2, \\]\n\\[ CF^2 = |\\vec{F} - \\vec{C}|^2. \\]",
      "z": 2.1486634535731293
